flowchart TD
    S([START]) --> L[load_invoice<br/>validate request, case/thread ID, correlation ID]
    L -->|invalid request| E([END])
    L -->|valid| M[three_way_match<br/>deterministic rules: Decimal, exact IDs]
    M --> R{route_by_exception}
    R -->|AUTO_CLEAR| DC[direct_clear]
    R -->|"HOLD / DUPLICATE / high-risk vendor"| C[crew_reconciliation<br/>CrewAI memo]
    R -->|"NEEDS_INFORMATION / plain FINANCE_APPROVAL"| D
    DC --> D
    C -->|"failed, attempts left"| C
    C -->|"duplicate or 2+ flags"| A[autogen_dispute_review<br/>AutoGen critique]
    C -->|ok or escalated| D
    A -->|"failed, attempts left"| A
    A -->|ok or escalated| D
    D[deterministic_decision<br/>copied from rules, agents cannot override] --> X[explain_findings<br/>LangChain + Pydantic]
    X --> Q{approval required?}
    Q -->|yes| H[["human_approval<br/>interrupt() - pauses on thread CASE-id"]]
    Q -->|no| W
    H -->|"resume: approve / reject"| W[audit_write<br/>idempotent audit_log.jsonl]
    W --> E
